                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is Libas's biggest advantage?</h3>
                                        <p>Contemporary ethnic positioning + marketplace scale + Instagram-heavy content. Category modernisation for young Indian women.</p>
                                        <h3>Can new ethnic wear brands compete?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes in category niching (specific regional styles, luxury, occasion specialty, sustainable, diaspora-focused). Libas dominates contemporary mainstream.</p>
                                        <h3>Should ethnic wear brands do Myntra + Amazon?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes for volume + discovery. Reserve premium + occasion collections for brand.com. Balanced omnichannel wins.</p>
